{%- comment -%}
  sophior-ring — Jaarringen SVG motief
  Houtjaarringen als visueel brand-element voor SOPHIOR.

  Parameters:
    variant  {String}  'logo' | 'divider' | 'badge'
    class    {String}  extra CSS-klassen op de SVG/wrapper (optioneel)
    label    {String}  badge-tekst, alleen bij variant 'badge' (optioneel)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case variant -%}

  {%- when 'logo' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Variant A — 4 concentrische cirkels, viewBox 80×80.
      Gebruik: naast wordmark in header (36px) en footer (28px).
      Kleur en grootte via .sophior-header__ring of .sophior-footer__ring.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="sophior-ring sophior-ring--logo{{ class | prepend: ' ' }}"
         viewBox="0 0 80 80"
         fill="none"
         aria-hidden="true"
         focusable="false">
      <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="8"  stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'divider' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Variant B — 3 cirkels, viewBox 32×32.
      Gebruik: gecentreerd in .sophior-section-divider tussen twee gradiëntlijnen,
      boven section titles (na eyebrow-tekst).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sophior-section-divider{{ class | prepend: ' ' }}" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="sophior-section-divider__line"></span>
      <svg class="sophior-ring sophior-ring--divider"
           viewBox="0 0 32 32"
           fill="none"
           aria-hidden="true"
           focusable="false">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="4"  stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9"  stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="sophior-section-divider__line sophior-section-divider__line--right"></span>
    </div>

  {%- when 'badge' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Variant C — 3 cirkels, viewBox 56×56, met optionele badge-tekst.
      Gebruik: absolute gepositioneerd top-right op collection cards.
      Kleur en positie via .sophior-collections-grid__card-badge.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="sophior-ring-badge{{ class | prepend: ' ' }}" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="sophior-ring sophior-ring--badge"
           viewBox="0 0 56 56"
           fill="none"
           focusable="false">
        <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="8"  stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="26" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/>
      </svg>
      {%- if label != blank -%}
        <span class="sophior-ring-badge__text">{{ label }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>

{%- endcase -%}
